{"version":1,"content":"<p>名媛林恬兒（Emily）與何柱國兒子何正德結婚近12年，並育有一對子女，向來表現恩愛。</p><p>去年10月林恬兒生日時，何正德更曾在社交平台公開感謝愛妻的支持，豈料事隔不足一年，這段豪門婚姻便宣告觸礁。</p><p>今年8月中，何正德被拍到在加拿大街頭與一名任職保</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:14:56.427505+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:13.339287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:13.339287+00:00","content_hash":"462c1f01aed48df5a0178c8a6108fb4ae253a9905dcd732c829461aafb39f32f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}